sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuário
    participant W as docchain-web<br/>(Next.js)
    participant A as docchain-api<br/>(NestJS)
    participant CR as CryptoService
    participant ST as StorageService
    participant BC as BlockchainService
    participant DR as DocumentRegistry.sol<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>W: POST /login (email, senha)
    W->>A: POST /auth/login
    A->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email
    DB-->>A: passwordHash
    A->>A: bcrypt.compare
    A-->>W: 200 + Set-Cookie: access_token (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax, Max-Age=900)
    Note over W,A: Sessão estabelecida via cookie httpOnly<br/>JS do frontend NÃO acessa o token
    U->>W: Seleciona arquivo (max 50 MB)
    U->>W: Clica "Registrar na Blockchain"
    W->>A: POST /documents (multipart, cookie auto)
    A->>A: JwtAuthGuard (cookieExtractor)
    A->>DB: INSERT Document (status=PENDING)
    A->>CR: hashFile(buffer) → SHA-256
    CR-->>A: hash
    A->>CR: encrypt(buffer) → AES-256-GCM
    CR-->>A: {ciphertext, iv, authTag}
    A->>ST: save(ciphertext, hash) → /uploads/{hash}.enc
    ST-->>A: storageRef
    A->>BC: registerDocument(hash, storageRef)
    BC->>DR: tx (assinada pela wallet do servidor)
    DR-->>BC: txHash + receipt (1 confirmação)
    BC-->>A: {txHash, blockNumber, walletAddress}
    A->>DB: UPDATE Document (status=CONFIRMED, txHash, iv, authTag)
    A-->>W: 201 + DocumentDto
    W-->>U: Tela de sucesso (hash + link Etherscan)
